---
import { getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import problemImage from '../../../src/assets/img/pexels-karola-g-5908818.webp';

const zinInputs = await getImage({ src: problemImage, format: 'webp', quality: 85 });
---
  <section class="sec sec-light">

    <div class="container">

      <div class="row">

        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-8 pe-5">

          <span class="zin-eyebrow">The lost thought problem.</span>

          <h2 class="zin-h2 mb-4">That great idea lasts about 10-20 seconds</h2>

          <p class="zin-body mb-3">
            If you keep walking and don’t repeat the thought to yourself, it may vanish before you reach for your phone. This includes your thought, insights and great ideas.
          </p>

          <p class="zin-body mb-3">
             Every longer-term thought is an open loop that keeps the brain constantly checking that it is still there. It  feels like distraction, or overwhelm, or being tired for no reason.
          </p>
          
          <p class="zin-body mb-3">
            The thoughts you did write down are not much better off, buried in years of posts, emails, documents and half-finished drafts. None of it available when it matters.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4">

          <img
          src={problemImage.src}
          alt="Zin — lack of capture is the problem"
          class="solution-img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>